<section class="lesson-section"><h3>Discovery</h3><p>Would that test reflect the information available when a real loan decision is made?</p></section>
<section class="lesson-section"><h3>Concept</h3><p>Financial data changes over time and labels may arrive late. Use temporal validation, check calibration and subgroup error, document feature availability, and follow applicable governance.</p></section>
